					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Funny you should mention that. I have a Foundation sitcom that's been sitting in my sandbox since last fall. I never posted it because I wasn't sure how it would fare, but the fact that this has a positive rating makes me thinks it might have a chance.</p> <p>If you like you could take a look at it and message me with any thoughts you might have. It's under the tab <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/dr-chandra">Habil and Qabil.</a></p> <p>This was great though, although I am biased towards older scips <em>and</em> I actually like crossovers, may the Broken God have mercy on my soul. You've got my upvote.</p> 
				 	]]>
